        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed</strong> is a cozy idle-mining simulator that quietly runs on your screen. Guide a lone dwarf miner as he digs through the cursed lands beneath the world of Sin Slayers—collecting gems and uncovering the darkness below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig through cursed lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip away at rock—gathering valuable gems buried deep beneath forgotten battlefields and haunted crypts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect gems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides new surprises. Use your findings to unlock fresh mining zones, upgrade gear, and keep the dig going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned loot on stronger pickaxes, faster digging, and a bigger backpack. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle-friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed runs quietly at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day. Whether you're working, studying, or slaying sins elsewhere, your miner keeps digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong><i> Steam Deck is <strong>not supported by design</strong>. The game may launch, but performance and controls are not optimized for Steam Deck.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed</strong> is a cozy idle-mining simulator that quietly runs on your screen. Guide a lone dwarf miner as he digs through the cursed lands beneath the world of Sin Slayers—collecting gems and uncovering the darkness below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig through cursed lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chip away at rock—gathering valuable gems buried deep beneath forgotten battlefields and haunted crypts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect gems</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer hides new surprises. Use your findings to unlock fresh mining zones, upgrade gear, and keep the dig going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned loot on stronger pickaxes, faster digging, and a bigger backpack. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle-friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin Slayers: Meat &amp; Greed runs quietly at the bottom of your screen while you go about your day. Whether you're working, studying, or slaying sins elsewhere, your miner keeps digging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong><i> Steam Deck is <strong>not supported by design</strong>. The game may launch, but performance and controls are not optimized for Steam Deck.</i></p>",
